  "html": "<p>感謝各位師長、學長姐及校友踴躍參與臺科大 49 週年校慶日，讓活動現場充滿了朝氣與活力，特別感謝 DIGITIMES 黃逸平副總經理為 EMRD 帶來精彩的「ChatGPT 後的生成式 AI 發展趨勢」講座，晚間我們更是凝聚在校慶晚宴中一同高歌「世界第一等」，展現了 EMRD 的團隊精神。明年，臺科大將迎來 50 週年生日，期待各位學長姐與校友重返母校齊聚，共同慶祝這特別的時刻！</p>\n<p><strong>113 年臺科大 49 週年校慶活動集錦</strong></p>\n<p><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Qx8TWYGXNFo\" title=\"113/03/28 113 年臺科大 49 週年校慶\"></iframe></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/8fcda50ead-263494040.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/f0d5826576-612609381.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>校慶繞場活動合照&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; EMRD 師長、學員與校友預備繞場</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/c00398536a-539476065.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/3d7fb7ee84-601455993.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>EMRD 師長、學員與校友繞場&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;EMRD 師長、學員與校友繞場&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/db5bc0d8ef-784490534.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/1f03e15713-102397224.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>運動員宣誓&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 校慶繞場活動合照</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/3378e1dd48-254759763.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/ffcd6f0b70-219981445.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>校慶繞場活動合照&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 111 級學員合照</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/21bae90204-145922724.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/420be964d7-281157697.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>112&nbsp;級學員合照&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;校慶繞場活動合照&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/3e31ea144f-197120718.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/802e46ac58-600961376.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>校慶講座&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;講師：DIGITIMES 黃逸平副總經理</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/697a66433d-189665352.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/81da4ce3ae-912372580.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>校慶講座&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;校慶講座合照</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/867d6a79ac-456026417.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/2316211676-740154431.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>校慶晚宴&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;校慶晚宴合照</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/da2c90caf0-903658569.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/87c4693f29-724851438.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;校慶晚宴合照&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 校慶晚宴合照</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/dfde1bc7e0-855297897.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/90922fdd09-666609558.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;校慶晚宴合照&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 校慶晚宴合照</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/c486c1c465-488293602.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/3a07b8844a-732102652.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;校慶晚宴合照&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 校慶晚宴合照</p>",
